5
00:00:10.813 --> 00:00:11.837
(audience applauding)

6
00:00:11.837 --> 00:00:13.262
I know! I love that!

7
00:00:13.262 --> 00:00:14.454
Fantastic!

8
00:00:14.454 --> 00:00:17.750
City Pier Seafood's easy entertaining kit.

9
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.960
I love this.

10
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.470
City Pier Seafood is a family-owned company

11
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.980
